    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a girl who has shut herself in her home and refuses to leave. she must explore and find her memories if she ever wants to escape her past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.You will explore various areas and talk to different people to piece together the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.collect your memories and us them to get to new areas and find secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3.See all 4 of the  endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4.you may also find more story with hidden diary entries spread across the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by Yume nikki and various classic RPG Maker horror games.</p>",
